      "start_ms": 360340,
      "end_ms": 362440,
      "text": "那穷人他没钱没钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 362440,
      "end_ms": 363430,
      "text": "这条路走不通"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 363430,
      "end_ms": 364780,
      "text": "那么你就要走"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 366639,
      "end_ms": 369509,
      "text": "西安人的用工单位跟垫付嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 369509,
      "end_ms": 370619,
      "text": "他是工伤啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 370619,
      "end_ms": 373540,
      "text": "所工伤理赔这条路嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 373540,
      "end_ms": 375220,
      "text": "要么就是侵权吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 375220,
      "end_ms": 376300,
      "text": "侵权责任的路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 376300,
      "end_ms": 377760,
      "text": "要么就是工商这条路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 377760,
      "end_ms": 378720,
      "text": "工商这样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 378720,
      "end_ms": 380640,
      "text": "他但是不能都走都走"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 380640,
      "end_ms": 381600,
      "text": "不要这两笔钱了嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 381600,
      "end_ms": 383040,
      "text": "你只能走其中一个好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 383040,
      "end_ms": 386980,
      "text": "你工商这条路那要垫付啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 386980,
      "end_ms": 389920,
      "text": "你本身这个职工没有能力垫付的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 389920,
      "end_ms": 391440,
      "text": "那家企业也要垫付啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 391440,
      "end_ms": 393660,
      "text": "啊他这个账上没钱垫个屁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 393660,
      "end_ms": 396840,
      "text": "我靠那如果说没有我们公益小组"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 396840,
      "end_ms": 398930,
      "text": "没有上海啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 398930,
      "end_ms": 402350,
      "text": "那么多公益小组我也没叫朝晖啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 402350,
      "end_ms": 403490,
      "text": "还有什么春雨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 403490,
      "end_ms": 404450,
      "text": "什么星火"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 404450,
      "end_ms": 405630,
      "text": "我靠什么呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 405630,
      "end_ms": 407550,
      "text": "我这个work out是我的口癖啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 407550,
      "end_ms": 410549,
      "text": "啊不是说我对你们缺乏敬意啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 410549,
      "end_ms": 412679,
      "text": "还有包括就叫上海公益小组"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 412679,
      "end_ms": 414509,
      "text": "没有这些人垫付的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 414509,
      "end_ms": 416399,
      "text": "那这个logo可能终身残疾了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 416399,
      "end_ms": 417269,
      "text": "他没钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 417269,
      "end_ms": 420310,
      "text": "你知道吗啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 420310,
      "end_ms": 422440,
      "text": "人家本来就是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 422440,
      "end_ms": 423700,
      "text": "古代有句话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 423700,
      "end_ms": 426140,
      "text": "什么什么衙门"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 426140,
      "end_ms": 428540,
      "text": "什么朝朝朝北还是朝南"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 428540,
      "end_ms": 430460,
      "text": "开一张有理无钱莫进来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 430460,
      "end_ms": 432560,
      "text": "现在他送到医院去没钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 432560,
      "end_ms": 434320,
      "text": "粉碎性骨折不给治"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 438360,
      "end_ms": 439880,
      "text": "这个也是我挺纳闷的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 439880,
      "end_ms": 441560,
      "text": "你知道吗啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 441560,
      "end_ms": 442940,
      "text": "那主治医生第一天跟他说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 442940,
      "end_ms": 444200,
      "text": "总共要6万块钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 444200,
      "end_ms": 445280,
      "text": "我们吓死了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 445280,
      "end_ms": 447460,
      "text": "我要我要这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 448920,
      "end_ms": 451040,
      "text": "就难道他没有6万块钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 451040,
      "end_ms": 456050,
      "text": "这个人就眼睁睁活生生看着他腿就这样烂掉吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 456050,
      "end_ms": 458600,
      "text": "哦原来后来不是第一笔手术"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 458600,
      "end_ms": 459260,
      "text": "不要那么多钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 459260,
      "end_ms": 460720,
      "text": "1万多块钱就好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 461759,
      "end_ms": 463339,
      "text": "你懂吗啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 464419,
      "end_ms": 468460,
      "text": "这种东西我真的是觉得啊世间冷暖可以"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 468460,
      "end_ms": 470260,
      "text": "一只也可以从"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 470260,
      "end_ms": 472780,
      "text": "但是这对这个东西小朋友你不知道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 472780,
      "end_ms": 473880,
      "text": "我早就知道了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 475240,
      "end_ms": 478230,
      "text": "我没想到这个上海这个公益小组这么有钱啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 478230,
      "end_ms": 482540,
      "text": "啊我本来还想就说这个什么这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 484660,
      "end_ms": 485940,
      "text": "什么蚂蚁金服"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 485940,
      "end_ms": 488520,
      "text": "或者说那个什么什么微信微粒贷"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 488520,
      "end_ms": 492250,
      "text": "什么借个借个一两万块钱去给他救个急的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 492250,
      "end_ms": 494620,
      "text": "现在看来不需要我们的钱呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 496100,
      "end_ms": 499930,
      "text": "但是说我们会尽量帮他去啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 499930,
      "end_ms": 502120,
      "text": "走保险理赔我们啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 502120,
      "end_ms": 504600,
      "text": "我们这个5年四班的这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 507280,
      "end_ms": 510990,
      "text": "给他提供了法律咨询"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 510990,
      "end_ms": 512159,
      "text": "法务咨询啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 512159,
      "end_ms": 514679,
      "text": "也提供了这个律师啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 514679,
      "end_ms": 516299,
      "text": "如果他有意向啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 516299,
      "end_ms": 518099,
      "text": "要要这个诉讼的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 518480,
      "end_ms": 519679,
      "text": "可以吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 519679,
      "end_ms": 523740,
      "text": "因为这工伤赔偿光是保险赔的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 523940,
      "end_ms": 525440,
      "text": "只能覆盖一部分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 525440,
      "end_ms": 529160,
      "text": "其中还会有一部分是这个恩宇物流公"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 529160,
      "end_ms": 530300,
      "text": "什么什么公司啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 530300,
      "end_ms": 532040,
      "text": "有限公司啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 532040,
      "end_ms": 533280,
      "text": "是他要赔的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 533620,
      "end_ms": 535360,
      "text": "到时候是可以向他追偿的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 535360,
      "end_ms": 538030,
      "text": "这个工商包括工商的评级啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 538030,
      "end_ms": 542240,
      "text": "啊这个东西我们会安排专员去帮忙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 546200,
      "end_ms": 549510,
      "text": "这个号应该有一些呃志愿者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 549510,
      "end_ms": 552600,
      "text": "他就是在好的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 552600,
      "end_ms": 555120,
      "text": "就直接就在上海成立公益小组的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 555120,
      "end_ms": 556800,
      "text": "这是个双重关系了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 556800,
      "end_ms": 560199,
      "text": "一方面是作为公益小组和我们有这个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 560520,
      "end_ms": 562620,
      "text": "这个行动方式上的呼应"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 562620,
      "end_ms": 565800,
      "text": "另一方面他直接这些人就是5年四班这个呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 565800,
      "end_ms": 569980,
      "text": "这个劳动咨询啊里面的成员了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 569980,
      "end_ms": 571079,
      "text": "志愿者了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 572760,
      "end_ms": 574760,
      "text": "啊这些志愿者里面啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 574760,
      "end_ms": 580350,
      "text": "不知道有没有哪位是有这个律师职业自制的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 580350,
      "end_ms": 581690,
      "text": "可以啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 581690,
      "end_ms": 582410,
      "text": "跟我们联系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 582410,
      "end_ms": 583190,
      "text": "应该有吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 583190,
      "end_ms": 583670,
      "text": "我不知道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 583670,
      "end_ms": 584840,
      "text": "哎哟可能没有了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 584840,
      "end_ms": 585500,
      "text": "没有的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 585500,
      "end_ms": 588710,
      "text": "那律师的话可以异地代理啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 588710,
      "end_ms": 589700,
      "text": "没问题啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 589700,
      "end_ms": 590600,
      "text": "那也不会"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 590600,
      "end_ms": 593020,
      "text": "但是一定要他亲自跑过去吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 593780,
      "end_ms": 595480,
      "text": "可以想个办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 595480,
      "end_ms": 596200,
      "text": "我们来想办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 596200,
      "end_ms": 597340,
      "text": "反正我们后面来想办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 597340,
      "end_ms": 598780,
      "text": "这个我们来想办法啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 598780,
      "end_ms": 603880,
      "text": "这个呃最后理赔剩下来的那一部分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 603880,
      "end_ms": 607959,
      "text": "我们会就是这些钱里面肯定已经有2万多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 607959,
      "end_ms": 608679,
      "text": "26000了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 608679,
      "end_ms": 612750,
      "text": "我我当时我今天白天知道这个已经有26000了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 612750,
      "end_ms": 614910,
      "text": "应该现在可能不止了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 614910,
      "end_ms": 615510,
      "text": "我不知道啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 615510,
      "end_ms": 616330,
      "text": "不确定啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 616330,
      "end_ms": 619540,
      "text": "那么可能到时候就这些钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 621380,
      "end_ms": 623770,
      "text": "啊就相当于志愿者的了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 623770,
      "end_ms": 628200,
      "text": "因为后面可能还要给钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 628200,
      "end_ms": 630120,
      "text": "总共总体治疗都要"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 630120,
      "end_ms": 634300,
      "text": "但是说有一些票据就可以先去报销一部分吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 634300,
      "end_ms": 635320,
      "text": "应该是吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 635320,
      "end_ms": 640280,
      "text": "我不知道这个险这个什么这个什么什么险"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 640280,
      "end_ms": 644500,
      "text": "我靠这个算社会保险"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 644500,
      "end_ms": 646780,
      "text": "他这个赔付机制又是怎么样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 646780,
      "end_ms": 649620,
      "text": "所有这些机制当中的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 650280,
      "end_ms": 651770,
      "text": "憨憨怠慢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 651770,
      "end_ms": 653240,
      "text": "我都看到一种恶意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 653240,
      "end_ms": 658409,
      "text": "叫我现在不能把这些恶意说成说是一种敌意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 658409,
      "end_ms": 660140,
      "text": "我只能说是一种恶意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 661020,
      "end_ms": 662120,
      "text": "我只能这样说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 662120,
      "end_ms": 663200,
      "text": "我只能这样说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 663200,
      "end_ms": 665870,
      "text": "但是这位这位老哥他怎么想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 665870,
      "end_ms": 667300,
      "text": "那就不知道了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 668060,
      "end_ms": 670560,
      "text": "那这一个是运气好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 671400,
      "end_ms": 677620,
      "text": "恰好这个公益活动呢在这个上海有好多小组啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 680060,
      "end_ms": 682920,
      "text": "那之前那个75000不被执行的那个呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 684040,
      "end_ms": 685590,
      "text": "那那个棋手呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 685590,
      "end_ms": 690459,
      "text": "他对于社会会有会充满多大的恨意和恶意呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 690680,
      "end_ms": 695870,
      "text": "甚至是第一呢始作俑者其无后乎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 695870,
      "end_ms": 697400,
      "text": "虎四出于霞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 697400,
      "end_ms": 702839,
